				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think that one is close to final form on just about I think so I have by the way one of my hands a proofreading on his introductory now we put it in tack So that one's in very good shape and star nineteen fifty as noted here we're simply not including anymore McMallon's recommendation But you're ready to felt it repeated things that had already been said and he felt it was just so close to other groups And presumably there's some comment about that In earlier versions of this documentary summary document summary there are comments about why he was No what I mean is in the final volume that will publish there will be some mention that this was why they cannot include because of two great Well that brings up a question that I think is on the unresolved issues, but since you brought it up, there are a couple of places where we had better mention that there are some documents in between the ones that we are publishing because for example we have a nineteen thirty nine D but we do not have a nineteen thirty nine C that's yet been published that will not be published until Volume four if at all.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
