		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a40" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts78" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts79">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, in my several conversations today with various people, I spoke to Susan Bell, talking about the tribulations of getting reviewed.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
